  "summary": "postinstall beacon exfiltrates installer identity to ngrok tunnel",
  "details": "The package's package.json declares a postinstall lifecycle hook whose only behavior is to run `whoami` and POST the output to the hardcoded ngrok tunnel https://mourner-slot-explicit.ngrok-free.dev. This fires automatically on `npm install`, transmitting the installer's OS username to an anonymous attacker-controlled endpoint. The package ships no library code, no documented function, and no other content — the beacon is its sole purpose.",
